# Deliberately empty of VITE_API_URL.
#
# vercel.json proxies /api/* to the Railway backend, so the browser talks only
# to its own origin and apiClient.ts falls back to a relative "/api". That keeps
# requests same-origin, which means CORS never applies and the backend's origin
# allowlist does not need to know this site exists.
#
# Set VITE_API_URL here only if you move to a host that cannot proxy. You would
# then also have to add this site's exact origin (https://www.rentoni.uz --
# note the www, rentoni.uz 308-redirects to it) to CORS_ORIGINS on the backend.
